; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - gold trend sleeve as a SMALL, HIGHLY LEVERAGED allocation ("pocket", chapter 106). EXTREME RISK inside this account.
; Idea: keep only 20-30% of the total money in this (commodity) account and the rest in the index account; restore that share once a year.
;   The two accounts have separate margin, so this sleeve cannot lose more than the money placed in this account;
;   in a strong gold trend the account multiplies (the position grows while it wins and shrinks while it loses).
; Rule (unchanged): hold gold while its daily close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days. Long only. Daily stop at 4 x daily volatility.
; Size: the position's own volatility is 100% of this account's equity per year (leverage about 5-8x; gold margin is 5%).
; This account alone - MT5 tester on OANDA's own data, JPY 3,000,000, account leverage 1:100, measured on daily equity:
;   last 3 years, real ticks: 2024 +220%, 2025 +1,122%, 2026 -47%; drawdown 80%; worst day -25.5%.
;   2007-2026: +11% per year, DRAWDOWN 99%, worst day -31%; 12 losing years out of 20 (down to -71%); 2025 +1,187%, 2010 +247%, 2024 +220%.
;   Run alone and never refilled, it loses almost everything in periods like 2012-2018. It is meant only as a small share that is refilled.
; Both accounts together (index account with AMS_Sleeves_Index_Growth.set 70% + this account 30%, share restored every year):
;   last 3 years, real ticks: +1,560% (+152% per year), drawdown 37%, calendar 2025 +361%, every 12-month window positive (worst +14%).
;   2007-2026: +42% per year, drawdown 54%, worst year -27%, one year above +300% (2025: +382%), 5 losing years.
;   Without 2025 the other 19 years grow +33% per year, below the index account alone (+38%): the pocket costs a few percent per year
;   in ordinary years and pays in a rare strong-trend year.
; To use only a part of a larger balance as the pocket, set InpIxEquityOffset to the amount NOT to be used
;   (example: balance 3,000,000 and pocket 750,000 -> InpIxEquityOffset=2250000; verified to give the same percentage results).
; Attach to an XAUUSD chart (H1).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=none
InpIxTrendSymbols=XAUUSD
InpIxRuleR2=false
InpIxRuleD7=false
InpIxRuleIBS=false
InpIxRevUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendUnitVol=100.0
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=0
InpIxVixFile=none
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,3
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxWarmStart=true
InpIxRegimeDays=0
InpIxRegimeRef=none
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=0
